## BillingApi

### Redeem ad credits
## Redeem ad credits
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ads_credit/redeem
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "offerCodeHash": "<string>",
 "validateOnly": "<string>"
}


### Get ads credit discounts
## Get ads credit discounts
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ads_credit/discounts?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Get download url for a billing invoice
## Get download url for a billing invoice
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/billing_invoice/{{billing_invoice_id}}/download
Accept: application/json

### Get billing invoices
## Get billing invoices
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/billing_invoices?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&order={{order}}&sort={{sort}}&status={{status}}&documentType={{documentType}}&startDueDate={{startDueDate}}&endDueDate={{endDueDate}}
Accept: application/json

### Get billing profiles
## Get billing profiles
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/billing_profiles?isActive={{isActive}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Salesforce account details including bill-to information.
## Get Salesforce account details including bill-to information.
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ssio/accounts
Accept: application/json

### Create insertion order through SSIO.
## Create insertion order through SSIO.
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ssio/insertion_orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "accepted_terms_id": "<string>",
 "accepted_terms_time": "<number>",
 "agency_link": "<string>",
 "billing_contact_email": "<string>",
 "billing_contact_firstname": "<string>",
 "billing_contact_lastname": "<string>",
 "billto_billing_address_id": "<string>",
 "billto_business_address_id": "<string>",
 "billto_company_id": "<string>",
 "budget_amount": "<number>",
 "currency_info": "<string>",
 "end_date": "<string>",
 "estimated_monthly_spend": "<number>",
 "media_contact_email": "<string>",
 "media_contact_firstname": "<string>",
 "media_contact_lastname": "<string>",
 "order_line_type": "<string>",
 "order_name": "<string>",
 "pmp_id": "<string>",
 "po_number": "<string>",
 "start_date": "<string>",
 "user_email": "<string>"
}


### Edit insertion order through SSIO.
## Edit insertion order through SSIO.
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ssio/insertion_orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "ads_manager_order_line_id": "<string>",
 "agency_link": "<string>",
 "billing_contact_email": "<string>",
 "billing_contact_firstname": "<string>",
 "billing_contact_lastname": "<string>",
 "budget_amount": "<number>",
 "end_date": "<string>",
 "media_contact_email": "<string>",
 "media_contact_firstname": "<string>",
 "media_contact_lastname": "<string>",
 "oracle_line_id": "<string>",
 "po_number": "<string>",
 "salesforce_order_id": "<string>",
 "salesforce_order_line_id": "<string>",
 "start_date": "<string>",
 "user_email": "<string>"
}


### Get insertion order status by ad account id.
## Get insertion order status by ad account id.
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ssio/insertion_orders/status?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Get insertion order status by pin order id.
## Get insertion order status by pin order id.
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ssio/insertion_orders/{{pin_order_id}}/status
Accept: application/json

### Get Salesforce order lines by ad account id.
## Get Salesforce order lines by ad account id.
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ssio/order_lines?pinOrderId={{pinOrderId}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json
